<title>USA: Potlatch Corp Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Potlatch Corp Q3 net falls.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAN FRANCISCO, Oct 10 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			 Sept 30 1996	   Sept 30  1995</p>
<p> Shr			     $0.68		   $1.09</p>
<p> Net			    19,541		  31,749</p>
<p> Revs			  398,227		 411,186</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     28,845		  29,147</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr			     $1.38		   $2.71</p>
<p> Net			    39,704		  79,186</p>
<p> Revs			1,172,916	     1,203,037</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     28,899		  29,198</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>Note - Results for the nine months ended Sept. 30, 1996 include a charge of $2.95 million or $0.10 a share for early extinguishment of debt.</p>
